154.16:
Baruḵ be 𐤉𐤄𐤅𐤄, who has delivered the oppressed from the hand of the wicked;
Who raises up a horn out of Ya’aqoḇ,
And a Judge of the nations out of Yisra’ĕl,

155.15:
From You, O 𐤉𐤄𐤅𐤄, is my confidence;
I cried to 𐤉𐤄𐤅𐤄, and He heard me,
And healed the breaking of my heart.

157.1:
I shall remember you, O Tsiyon, for a beraḵah.
I love you with all My strength;
For your remembrance is to be baruḵ forever.
